# CapSolver API key for WebVac (template)
#
# Copy this file to the repo root as capsolver.key (gitignored), then paste
# your real key on its own line OR as CAPSOLVER_API_KEY=...
#
#   copy examples\capsolver.example.key capsolver.key     # Windows
#   cp examples/capsolver.example.key capsolver.key       # Linux / macOS
#
# Then run:
#   python -m webvac --url https://example.com --mode single --captcha-solver capsolver
#
# If capsolver.key contains a key, --captcha-solver capsolver is optional
# (still pass --captcha-solver none to disable).
#
# Do NOT commit capsolver.key. Do not paste your key into this example file.

# Paste your CapSolver key below (replace this line):
CAPSOLVER_API_KEY=YOUR_CAPSOLVER_KEY_HERE
